  "body": "Changes add conditionalized RFC 7474 strict seq number check compatibility.\r\n\r\nIf disabled (default), equal sequence numbers are rejected (>=), if enabled only strictly lower sequence numbers are rejected (>).\r\n\r\nThe compatibility can be enabled globally or per interface, with the per-interface setting overriding the global setting.\r\n\r\nConfiguration commands added:\r\nRouter node: [no] compatible rfc7474\r\nInterface node: [no] ip ospf compatible rfc7474 [A.B.C.D]\r\n\r\nFixes issue https://github.com/FRRouting/frr/issues/21387",
